SCOPE

The MIT license above covers the contents of this repository: the Dockerfiles,
scripts, and configuration that run Calliope AI desktop applications in Kasm
Workspaces.

It does not cover those applications. The images built here bundle the Calliope
AI desktop applications, which are proprietary, free to use, and licensed
separately; see the LICENSE in calliopeai/calliope-ai-desktop-releases. An MIT
wrapper does not relicense its payload.

So: fork this repository, change it, redistribute it. Redistributing the built
images, which contain the applications, needs permission under the desktop
license instead.
